cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use millstone, please cite it as:"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Castelló March"
    given-names: Enric
title: "millstone: a deterministic symbolic engine for grammatical characterization of closed corpora"
version: 0.1.1
date-released: 2026-10-30
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.23804059"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/Ecm83/millstone"
abstract: >-
  A deterministic, language-agnostic engine that characterizes the
  grammatical topology of closed or undeciphered corpora —
  hierarchical corpus model, a regular constraint DSL with
  decidable entailment, Pareto frontier discovery, MDL accounting,
  pre-registered signature battery, null models, transcription
  consensus, and a decipherment testbed — applied to the Voynich
  Manuscript and 10+ other corpora.
preferred-citation:
  type: software
  authors:
